          with_plan(rn: ticket_row(id: "2-scm-publication-ladder", done: false, t: TicketFields {
            headline: "publication capability profile + locked realizations (design)",
            brief: "Publish profiles independent source/interface disclosure, artifact delivery, local/remote execution, integrity/reproducibility, existence/churn leakage, revocation/erase, and placement. Locked blobs use context-bound AEAD plus authenticated key wraps; interface/realization is the cut and statement holes refuse. Client keys mean plaintext access. Remote execution and diagnostics obey information-flow/declassification. Commitments carry a threat model; cryptographic erase is conditional on sanitizing every key, copy, cache, derivative, and recovery path.",
