            out_of_scope: "Native object store, common-SCM extraction before three upstream models, vendor enum/switch, full forge UI, proof vocabulary in primary messages, arbitrary-language integration outside declared fidelity, mind-reading, weighted likely-intent, pairwise interaction catalogs, global completeness claims, delegating mechanical work to the user, or hiding a terminal refusal in inspect-only state.",
