            headline: "design-partner shadow — read-only Git-in/Git-out agent landing",
            brief: "Run the source-intent assessment beside one qualified agent-heavy team's existing GitHub/GitLab workflow without source-ref write authority. Import ordinary proposals at honest fidelity, compare would-land/question/refusal with the actual integration path, and retain only audience-authorized receipts. The partner keeps its forge, target, editor, CI, and exit.",
