            content: "**srv1 deploy failure incident** — the narrow readiness/tree-sync failures were made unwritable by #7077/#7086; four latest eligible main deploys (30224923617, 30223101157, 30223078047, 30214329929) are green. The live-runner transport root and the separate CI-verdict question remain on the two named successors."
          ),
          ticket_row(id: "ts-deploy-verdict-isolation", done: false, t: TicketFields {
            headline: "decide whether deploy failure shares the code-health CI conclusion",
            brief: "The srv1 deployment can fail on host state after the code floor is green. Decide whether that failure should red the same CI conclusion, report as a separate deployment verdict, or gate a different admission surface. The historical incident is healed; this is the unresolved product meaning of main-green.",
            displaced_cost: "host-state failures continue to make code health and deployment health indistinguishable",
